### 名單 CRM smoke test
@base = http://localhost:1138/api

### 取得全部名單
GET {{base}}/contacts

### 新增名單
POST {{base}}/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "王小明",
  "location": "中壢",
  "contact": "0912-345-678",
  "broached": false,
  "completedStages": [],
  "followUpFreq": "一週一次"
}

### 部分更新（inline）
PATCH {{base}}/contacts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "broached": true
}

### 更新頻率 → 重算下次跟進日
PATCH {{base}}/contacts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "followUpFreq": "兩週一次",
  "lastFollowUp": "2026-11-07"
}

### 新增跟進紀錄
POST {{base}}/contacts/1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-11-07",
  "content": "電話聊了一陣子，聊到產品心得"
}

### 取得跟進紀錄
GET {{base}}/contacts/1/logs

### 進度階段
GET {{base}}/contact-stages

### 新增階段
POST {{base}}/contact-stages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "加入"
}

### 人名選項
GET {{base}}/contact-options

### 地點選項
GET {{base}}/contact-locations

### 刪除名單
DELETE {{base}}/contacts/1
